{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01813","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离二首 一 · 李端","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国叶黄时，洞庭霜落夜。\n行舟闻商估，宿在枫林下。\n此地送君还，茫茫似梦间。\n後期知几日，前路转多山。\n巫峡通湘浦，迢迢隔云雨。\n天晴见海樯，月落闻津鼓。\n人老自多愁，水深难急流。\n清宵歌一曲，白首对汀洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}